  "description": "Yeon-Jin, whose shoulders have become stiff from a long career, is recommended to \\[Dang's Massage Shop\\] by a friend, and receives treatment from the director, Hyun-Hu...\n\n *\"Would it be okay if I do some special treatment?\"*\n\nWith each special treatment, her body gets hotter and hotter, and Yeon-Jin loses her reason and attacks Hyun-Hu. \n\n *\"Aren't you hot, sir? My whole body is hot...\"* \n\nWill Yeon-Jin be able to regain her health with Hyun-Hu's special treatment?\n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated)",
